an> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.33</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HF</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">266</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ra.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">228</span> </span>, etc.); <span class=\"gk\">φιλοσόφου τὰ αὑτοῦ πράξαντος καὶ οὐ πολυπραγμονήσαντος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Grg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">526c</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">33a</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">οὐδ' εὖ.. οἰκοῦνται αἱ πόλεις, ὅταν τὰ αὑτῶν ἕκαστοι πράττωσι</span> (ironical) <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Alc.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.127b</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μὴ τὰ αὑτῶν π.</span> not to <b class=\"lex-tr\">act</b> their <b class=\"lex-tr\">part,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">452c</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">π. τὰ δέοντα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Mem.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.8.1</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">5</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">manage</b> affairs, <b class=\"lex-tr\">do</b> business, <b class=\"lex-tr\">act,</b> <span class=\"gk\">εἰπεῖν τε καὶ πρᾶξαι</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.9.4</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.8.6</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">πράττειν τὰ πολιτικὰ πράγματα, τὰ τῆς πόλεως,</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">manage</b