r\">manage</b> matters for their interest, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">19.77</span> </span>:—so in <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">τῷ Ἱπποκράτει τὰ.. πράγματα ἀπό τινων ἀνδρῶν.. ἐπράσσετο</span> matters <b class=\"lex-tr\">were negotiated</b> with him by.., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.76</span> </span>: but freq. abs., <b class=\"lex-tr\">treat, negotiate, manage, act,</b> <span class=\"gk\">οἱ πράσσοντες αὐτῷ</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">110</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.76</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">π. πρός τινα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.5</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.73</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">ἐς</span> ( v.l. πρὸς )<span class=\"gk\"> τοὺς βαρβάρους, ἐς τοὺς Εἵλωτας,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.131</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">132</span> </span>:—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">ἐπράττετο οὐ πρὸς τοὺς ἄλλους</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aeschin.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.64</span> </span>; also <span class=\"gk\">π. τι ὑπὲρ τῶν κοινῶν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">26.2</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">π. ὑπὲρ τῆς πόλεως τὰ πάτρια</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">59.73</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">π. περὶ εἰρήνης</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.3.3</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">π. τῇ δύναιτο ἄριστα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.30</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">π. ὡς ἄριστα καὶ πιστότατα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.129</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">οἱ πράσσοντες</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">the traitors,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.89</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">113</span> </span>:—folld. by dependent clauses, <span class=\"gk\">πρᾶσσε καὶ τὰ ἐμὰ καὶ τὰ σὰ ὅπῃ κάλλιστα ἕξει</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.129</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐς τὴν Πελοπόννησον ἔπρασσεν, ὅπῃ ὠφελία τις γενήσεται</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">65</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">π. ὅπως πόλεμος γένηται</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">57</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">π. ὅπως τιμωρήσονται</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">56</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.4</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">70</span> </span>, etc.: c. acc. et <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span>, <span class=\"gk\">μὴ δεῦρο πλεῖν τὴν ναῦν ἔπραττεν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">32.22</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"4\"><span class=\"lex-n\">b</span> esp. of secret practices and intrigues, <span class=\"gk\">εἴ τι μὴ ξὺν ἀργύρῳ ἐπράσσετ' ἐνθένδ'</span> unless some bribery <b cla